{
	"id": "catch-tag",
	"text": "We can also handle errors one by one. With catchTag, we target VeryBadRoll specifically and recover with -9000. And once we do, our error type narrows. TooHigh remains because we haven't handled it yet. Of course, we can add a second catchTag and handle TooHigh by returning zero. Now, once again, our effect cannot fail.",
	"code": "const weirdDie: Effect.Effect<number, VeryBadRoll | TooHigh> =\n  slowDie",
